          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kupindikula kwa Simoni na Lawi kwajili ya nnumbwao",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liduva limo, Dina, mwali wanga Yakobo wammelekedile Leya, nkuhwena unavaongela vamahe va chilambo anecho cha Vahivi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Hamoli njo anavele nkulungwa wa chilambo anecho. Bahi Shekemu mwana wanga Hamoli pammwene Dina, nkunkamula nkuntula na kunnala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga Shekemu nkunowelwa namene na ayula mwali, nkuntamwa namene na kutandilika kulonjela nawe saana uchinga antamwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Shekemu nkunnyaulila Hamoli atatake kuchidoni, “Chonde atata, ngùyuwa uning'e ayu mwali ààve n'jangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nkupilikana kuva Dina mwali wake àtaijwe dihoni na Shekemu, henga kwa kuva vana vake vávele kumachungani, nang'e nkunyalalila chihi mpaka pavauite kukaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Hamoli, atatake Shekemu, nkuhwena kwanga Yakobo unalonjela nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na vana vachilume vanga Yakobo pavapilikene chihi habali anedyo, nkuuyang'ana kuhaloka kumachungani. Vijana anevo dínivapwateka namene disungu, na kutunuuka namene, kwa kuva kwa kulala na mwali wanga Yakobo, Shekemu átendile chitendo chivachona Vaisilaeli kuva chitendo cha dihoni namene, chitendo chikáchilembelewa kutendwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga Hamoli nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Mwanangu Shekemu ànantamwa namene mwali wenu. Chonde ngùyuwa munnuhusu aende nawe ulombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leka tulombane, mwenu mutulombese vali venu na hwetu tunnombesange vali vetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mwenu muchimuikale pamo na hwetu, na kuva hulu nchilambo achino. Ikalanga nchilambo achino na kuchuusa na kupata dimali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uchocho, Shekemu nkunnyaulila atatake Dina na alangavake Dina kuchidoni, “Chonde, ngùyuwa ngukubaliwe pameho penu, nanangu nguchinimwing'ange chinu chohecho chimumbehaula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenu nguhaulile chihi nkaka umulembela na dinudyo, ata kudiva dyohe namuna ntwani, nangu nguchinguhumye kupapatana na namuna chimumbenguhaulila. Mwenu ning'e chihi ayu mwali ààve n'jangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi vana vachilume vanga Yakobo nkunnyang'ula Shekemu na Hamoli atatake kwa hila, kwa kuva nnumbwao Dina átaijwe dihoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Hwetu tukáhulula kuntwala nnumbwetu nkumwing'a munu akáyalwike. Kutenda uchocho ni dihoni kwetuhwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hwetu tuchitukubaliane na mwenu mukàtenda chinu chimo. Chinu anecho nni mwenu kuva muchi chituvele hwetu, kwa kunnyalula kila nnume mmwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo njo pamumbevalomba vali vetu na hwetu kuvalomba vali venu. Tuchituikale pamo na kuva utuvamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga mukàhita kukubaliana na hwetu na kuyalulwa, bahi hwetu tùmbentwala nnumbwetu na kuuka nawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malove anelo nkuva lambone pameho panga Hamoli na Shekemu mwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Shekemu, kijana achieshimika namene kupunda vanu vammalele vachiikala nng'ande mwa atatake, nang'e nanga panatimile kuhwena unalatenda àlalá lavavahaulidile, kwa kuva ánintamwa namene mwali wanga Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Hamoli na Shekemu mwanawe, nkuhwena pannango wa kuinjilila muimanga yavo, pachinu pavakojana vanu, nkulonjela na vanu vao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uvachidoni, “Ava vanu nni ayanjavetu. Bahi tuvakalibishe vaikale nchilambo chetu na kuchuusa, kwa kuva tùvele na chilambo cha kututosha hwetu na vanang'o, koka hwetu tuvalombe vali vao na vanang'o vavalombe vali vetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga vanang'o vàmbekubali kuikala na hwetu na kuva utuvamo tukàtenda chinu chimo. Kila nnume muhwetu àlembelewa ayalulwe muchi chivayalwike vanang'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dachi, mwenu nanga pamwona kuva anyama vao vammalele na dimali dyao dìmbekuva dyetu? Bahi tukubaliane navo uchinga vaikale pamo na hwetu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi alume vammalele vanakojêne pannango wa kuinjilila muimanga nkuyambukilana na Hamoli na Shekemu mwanawe. Bahi alume vammalele va imanga aneyo nkuyalulwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nniduva lya tatu lya kuyalulwa kwavo, wakati vammalele vilonda vivenkuukùtà namene, vana vavili vanga Yakobo, yani Simeoni na Lawi, alumbuvake Dina, nkutwala mapanga lavo, nkuhwena unaihavila aila imanga bila vene kumala na kuvawalala alume vammalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkummwalala kwa upanga Hamoli na Shekemu mwanawe, nkunhumya Dina nng'ande mwanga Shekemu, nkuukananga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo vana vanji vachilume vanga Yakobo nkuinjila muimanga aneyo nkutwala litwala dimali dyammalele ing'anya nnumbwao Dina átaijwe dihoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
